Subject: [PATCH] Adapt XLA build fixes to JAX 0.12.0 Bzlmod

Adapt the conda-forge XLA build fixes to JAX 0.12.0,
with the Clang 21/22 RAFT compatibility fix.

Preserve JAX's existing XLA archive patches and integrate
the conda build fixes through the Bzlmod patch mechanism.

Reference: https://github.com/openxla/xla/pull/51036

Co-authored-by: Albert Yau <albert@mwyau.com>
